menu "ZeroCode language model"

# One switch per model. Both blobs ship in the catalogue, but only a selected
# one is EMBEDded, so an NLU-only product does not carry 2 MB of story weights.
# A consuming block turns its model on from its own sdkconfig.defaults.

config ZC_LM_MODEL_NLU
    bool "Smart-home command parser (264 KB)"
    default n
    help
        Natural language to a schema-valid tool-call, byte tokenizer with
        constrained decoding. Used by drivers/lm_tool_calling. Fits the default
        4mb partition table comfortably.

config ZC_LM_MODEL_STORY
    bool "Story generation (2.0 MB)"
    default n
    help
        Free-running TinyStories generation with a BPE tokenizer and temperature
        sampling. Used by behaviors/lm_storyteller. NEEDS partition_table: 8mb —
        2.0 MB of weights plus the app overflows the default 4mb table's
        1.875 MB OTA slot by 20%.

config APP_LM_MAX_LISTENERS
    int "Maximum device+location listeners"
    default 8
    range 1 64
    help
        One per drivers/lm_tool_calling instance. Registering past this logs an
        error and the extra instance never fires.

endmenu
